From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:26:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: Add the IOMMUs

The A733 has two IOMMUs: IOMMU0 for USB, CSI, ISP and the video encoder,
IOMMU1 for the video decoder, the display engine, the deinterlacer, G2D
and EINK. Describe both. No device is put behind them yet, so all their
masters stay in bypass, the reset state.

Not covered: the video engine's MBUS port gates as "masterN" clocks,
which are only needed once a video engine master translates.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the IOMMUs at 0x3900000
and 0x3910000 probe with interrupts GIC 202 and 203, their eight bus
clocks are enabled and both bus gate and reset registers read back
0x00010007.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 26 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index b68cb5058217..98ef8b1ac5d5 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
@@ -549,6 +549,32 @@ ppi_partition1: interrupt-partition-1 {
 			};
 		};
 
+		iommu0: iommu@3900000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-iommu";
+			reg = <0x03900000 0x10000>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 170 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
+			clocks = <&ccu CLK_MBUS_IOMMU0_SYS>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_APB_IOMMU0_SYS>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_AHB_IOMMU0_SYS>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_MBUS_IOMMU0>;
+			clock-names = "mclk", "pclk", "hclk", "mbus";
+			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_IOMMU0_SYS>;
+			#iommu-cells = <1>;
+		};
+
+		iommu1: iommu@3910000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-iommu";
+			reg = <0x03910000 0x10000>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 171 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
+			clocks = <&ccu CLK_MBUS_IOMMU1_SYS>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_APB_IOMMU1_SYS>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_AHB_IOMMU1_SYS>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_MBUS_IOMMU1>;
+			clock-names = "mclk", "pclk", "hclk", "mbus";
+			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_IOMMU1_SYS>;
+			#iommu-cells = <1>;
+		};
+
 		mmc0: mmc@4020000 {
 			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-mmc",
 				     "allwinner,sun20i-d1-mmc";
